+/* Bound a child command in the SHELL. rtrafd is a single-threaded ~10 Hz
+ * collector with no watchdog: poll_classes() forks seven `tmctl` every 4 s and
+ * poll_probe() one `ping` every 5 s, and plain popen()/pclose() puts no ceiling
